{"id": "small-grantees-insider-loans", "title": "Three small City grantees with insider deals; a fourth whose return and books disagree", "seconds": 179.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "6a5230d06eae1907", "words": 453, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["story[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "Four small nonprofits paid by San Francisco.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.17, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["Three", "insider deals"], "sub": "and a fourth whose tax return and books disagree"}, "wt": [0.22, 0.33, 0.74, 1.53, 1.87, 2.05, 2.26]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["story[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "Three report, on their own tax returns, a money deal with the people who run them.", "t0": 3.29, "t1": 7.42, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["Three", "insider deals"], "sub": "and a fourth whose tax return and books disagree"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.91, 1.02, 1.17, 1.33, 1.59, 2.43, 2.51, 2.77, 2.96, 3.08, 3.17, 3.43, 3.6, 3.83]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 7.54, "t1": 9.48, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.18, 0.3, 1.04, 1.18, 1.28]}, {"scene": "kl", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[1]", "established[9]"], "text": "First, Kultivate Labs, paid 1.36 million dollars in fiscal 2025.", "t0": 9.7, "t1": 15.29, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Kultivate Labs", "kicker": "The first", "chip": "$1.36 million in fiscal 2025"}, "emph": ["1.36 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 1.0, 1.5, 1.96, 2.12, 2.48, 2.66, 2.91, 3.31, 3.79, 4.11, 4.5, 4.83]}, {"scene": "kl", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Since 2022 it has owed Plinth Agency 1