ildren’s department", "chip": "$405,546 in fiscal 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.42, 0.89, 1.47, 1.91, 2.07, 2.22, 2.58, 2.91, 3.49, 3.68, 3.97, 4.65]}, {"scene": "fa", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[6]"], "text": "Its chief executive got 239,121", "t0": 76.72, "t1": 80.49, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["speaking pay to the chief executive, 2023", "$239,121"], "b": ["speaking commission to a firm bearing his surname", "$126,071"]}, "emph": ["239,121"], "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.51, 1.0, 1.23, 1.36, 1.59, 2.13, 2.73, 2.97, 3.25]}, {"scene": "fa", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[6]"], "text": "dollars in 2023 for speaking.", "t0": 80.49, "t1": 83.59, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["speaking pay to the chief executive, 2023", "$239,121"], "b": ["speaking commission to a firm bearing his surname", "$126,071"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.76, 1.05, 1.26, 2.01, 2.62]}, {"scene": "fa", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[6]"], "text": "A firm bearing his surname got 126,071.", "t0": 83.71, "t1": 87.77, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["speaking pay to the chief executive, 2023", "$239,121"], "b": ["speaking commission to a firm bearing his surname", "$126,071"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.69, 0.86, 1.38, 1.59, 1.83, 2.17, 2.79, 3.3]}, {"scene": "fa", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Then, in 2024, a licensing deal between him and the group. Worth?", "t0": 87.89, "t1": 92.42, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A licensing deal, 2024", "kicker": "The third", "sub": "between the chief executive and the organisation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.36, 0.58, 1.63, 1.72, 2.25, 2.51, 2.85, 3.02, 3.08, 3.2, 3.72]}, {"scene": "fa", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[7]"], "text": "500,000 dollars.", "t0": 92.42, "t1": 94.64, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$500,000", "label": "cross l